* mrs.inpdate -> "StrokeMRS：Observation.effectiveDateTime" "code = http://loinc.org#75859-9；序號意義確認前，assessmentPhase=unclassified。只有年月或只有時間就不填，原值存 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* mrs.inpdate -> "StrokeMRS：Observation.effectiveDateTime" "code = http://loinc.org#75859-9；填原始各次評估日期，assessmentPhase=unclassified；不足完整日期就不填。"
